{"id": "DfRC9XRD3i8", "title": "Video by kahiyo.in", "description": "Part 1 · ध्रुव: सौतेली माँ ने गोद से उतारा\n\nपाँच साल का था वो… जब सौतेली माँ ने कहा, \"भगवान की गोद में जाकर बैठ।\" और वो सच में चला गया।\n\nअगर आप ध्रुव की जगह होते, तो क्या आप उस रात महल छोड़ देते? कमेंट में बताइए।\n\nपौराणिक कथा · भागवत और विष्णु पुराण की ध्रुव कथा का नाट्य रूपांतरण\n\n#ध्रुव #dhruv #पौराणिककथा #mythology #bhakti #narayan #vishnu #hindukatha #kahani #hindistory #microdrama", "channel": "kahiyo.in", "uploader_id": "32047977584", "uploader": "Kahiyo", "timestamp": 1793683802, "like_count": 33760, "comment_count": 25, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-18115800023065585a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 66.871, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMOry07lUGirbcWEu7XCZi3Q-TI5B-Hma0Y7Y-vFIXdez7n3KNAldmkBjHPrtBzxTp6W5DMBFQMSmvIt8nwzunzBEUkw7ffrRVTKWM.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_oc=AdrnQkvjL5OQdsqFdE87bI0_lzvf7NCfLLgYo8ZRbSV9_oA3E_pfU-YEIzmoU9POGBN2M1-7m9p8Kw_EQQTI-Pgu&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=sFS9md6-za4Q7kNvwEr4fbz&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=HNJnmOlSivU-ie6rA7Y6CA&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRTRuC6WJuPqFSltgObDtx5U2eyH2qaGf5rg4dLn6ZOWA&oe=6AF4310B", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 66.871, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,ap